'''Red Riding Mina''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] and can be unlocked when beating [[Learned to Love]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]] increases health, attack power and reach, is immune to Curse and can weaken [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relics]].

